  <section class="ch" id="landing" data-t="Landing page">
    <div class="ch-h"><h2><span class="n">07</span>Landing page</h2><p>The landing page is coded and live on GitHub Pages: scroll it right inside the window.</p></div>
    <div class="page">
      <div class="win live" data-native><iframe src="https://sashagrigori.github.io/slepok/?v=2" title="Slepok studio landing page" loading="lazy"></iframe></div>
      <aside>
        <p><a class="open" href="https://sashagrigori.github.io/slepok/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open website ↗</a></p>
        <p>Booking is on every screen: in the header, on the cards and at the end of each section.</p>
        <p>Scrolling tickers split the page into chapters and keep the rhythm.</p>
        <p>Reviews and parties are laid out like cards scattered across a table.</p>
      </aside>
    </div>
    <div class="pair">
