      <figure><img src="/img/slepok/thanks2.webp" alt="" loading="lazy"><figcaption class="cap"><span class="lab mut">Done</span><br>A promise to call back within 15&nbsp;minutes</figcaption></figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ch" id="mobile" data-t="Responsive">
    <div class="ch-h"><h2><span class="n">08</span>Responsive</h2><p>The same landing page on a phone: cards in two columns and horizontal carousels. The screens are captured from the live site.</p></div>
    <div class="screens">
      <figure><img src="/img/slepok/mob-1.webp" alt="" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span class="lab mut">First screen</span>List menu and booking within reach</figcaption></figure>
      <figure><img src="/img/slepok/mob-2.webp" alt="" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span class="lab mut">Upcoming</span>Workshops and studio photos</figcaption></figure>
      <figure><img src="/img/slepok/mob-3.webp" alt="" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span class="lab mut">Workshops</span>Group and private</figcaption></figure>
      <figure><img src="/img/slepok/mob-4.webp" alt="" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span class="lab mut">Courses</span>Basic and PRO with a monthly price</figcaption></figure>
      <figure><img src="/img/slepok/mob-5.webp" alt="" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span class="lab mut">Parties</span>What’s included and the gift certificate</figcaption></figure>
      <figure><img src="/img/slepok/mob-6.webp" alt="" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span class="lab mut">Reviews</span>And a call to make something together</figcaption></figure>
      <figure><img src="/img/slepok/mob-7.webp" alt="" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span class="lab mut">Where we sculpt</span>Map, schedule and contacts</figcaption></figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ch" id="result" data-t="Results">
    <div class="ch-h"><h2><span class="n">09</span>Results</h2><p>How the brand and the landing page meet the three objectives.</p></div>
    <dl class="kv" style="margin-top:0"><dt class="lab">Ease of use</dt><dd>Sections follow the three subgroups’ scenarios, booking is available from any screen, and the form has four fields.</dd>
      <dt class="lab">Uniqueness</dt><dd>The studio has a character of its own: a name with a double meaning, a loud logo and a mug mascot. Where other studios go for minimalism and pastels, Slepok has a wide typeface, rich colors and scrolling tickers.</dd>
      <dt class="lab">Vibrancy</dt><dd>The brand’s character made it into the interface: plasticine-style illustrations modeled on the mascot, scrolling tickers, animations on the first screen and in the parties section.</dd>
      <dt class="lab">Delivered</dt><dd>A study project from idea to launch: research, brand (name, logo, mascot), wireframes, UI kit, desktop, responsive layouts, states and transition animations in the prototype.</dd>
      <dt class="lab">Launch</dt><dd>The landing page is coded from the mockups and published: <a class="inl" href="https://sashagrigori.github.io/slepok/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">sashagrigori.github.io/slepok&nbsp;↗</a> Booking through the form, the first-screen and parties animations, and the mobile layout all work.</dd></dl>
  </section>
  </main>
